#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:8
msgid "Weblate features — quality translations, your control"
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:15
msgid "Bring your project to more people"
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:19
msgid ""
"Give people a great experience in their own language. Weblate brings your "
"team, community, and development workflow together to deliver quality "
"translations—with or without AI."
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:22
msgid ""
"Open source and privacy-respecting, with the freedom to choose how you "
"translate and where you run it."
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:23 weblate_web/templates/index.html:25
#: weblate_web/templates/index.html:69
#: weblate_web/templates/snippets/about.html:9
#: weblate_web/templates/snippets/pricing.html:117
msgid "Compare hosting and support"
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:25
#: weblate_web/templates/snippets/about.html:11
msgid "Try Hosted Weblate"
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:32
msgid "Keep translations in step with development"
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:33
msgid ""
"Connect your repository and let new strings reach translators as your "
"project evolves. Weblate brings translations back into version control, so "
"developers and translators can work together without passing files back and "
"forth."
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:34
msgid ""
"Weblate works with a local repository and commits translation changes back "
"to version control. Keep your existing branches, translation files, and code "
"hosting service, with attribution for contributors."
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:36
msgid "Explore continuous localization"
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:41
msgid "Give every translation the context it needs"
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:42
msgid ""
"Help translators understand what your users will see. Screenshots, nearby "
"strings, and source references make meaning clearer. Shared glossaries keep "
"terminology consistent, while translation memory helps your team reuse "
"previous work."
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:43
msgid ""
"Catch problems with customizable quality checks, discuss unclear wording, "
"and review contributions before considering them finished. Your team can "
"improve the source text as well as its translations."
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:46
msgid ""
"Weblate translation editor showing a French translation, a missing-"
"placeholder warning, glossary terminology, and a screenshot of the source "
"text in context"
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:48
msgid "Give your translators the tools to make informed choices."
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:51
msgid "Explore translation quality checks"
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:56
msgid "Choose how you translate—with or without AI"
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:57
msgid ""
"Translate entirely with people, or bring in machine translation and AI where "
"they help. Your team chooses the tools, the review process, and what reaches "
"your repository."
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:60
msgid "Translate without AI"
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:61
msgid ""
"Let people write and review translations with context, glossaries, "
"translation memory, and quality checks. None of these require an AI or "
"machine translation service."
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:64
msgid "Assist your translators"
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:65
msgid ""
"Offer optional machine translation or large language model (LLM) results in "
"the editor. Translators choose what to use, edit it, and decide what to save."
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:68
msgid "Start with machine translations"
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:69
msgid ""
"Generate translations for people to improve, or mark them as unfinished "
"drafts. Choose whether drafts can reach your repository while editing is "
"still in progress."
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:72
msgid "Accept suggestions before use"
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:73
msgid ""
"Keep generated text as suggestions for people to check. With automatic "
"acceptance disabled, suggestions only become translations when a person "
"accepts or edits them."
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:76
msgid "Approve before committing"
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:77
msgid ""
"Combine translation review with an approved-only commit policy. People can "
"edit generated translations in Weblate, while only reviewer-approved "
"translations reach your repository."
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:80
msgid "Evaluate translation quality"
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:81
msgid ""
"Optionally use an LLM to flag accuracy, fluency, terminology, style, and "
"formatting issues. Evaluation adds findings; it does not approve "
"translations or replace human review."
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:84
msgid "Combine the tools that fit your workflow"
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:85
msgid ""
"One workflow you can configure: reuse existing translations first, bring in "
"external services where needed, and require approval before committing."
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:87
msgid "New strings arrive from Git."
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:88
msgid "Reuse translation memory."
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:89
msgid "Request machine translation or LLM suggestions for remaining strings."
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:90
msgid "Optionally evaluate translations with AI."
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:91
msgid "Require human review where needed."
msgstr ""

#: weblate_web/templates/features.html:92
msgid "Commit eligible translations back to Git."
